00:14:32.421 --> 00:14:34.721
place, because that's where they mattered.

482
00:14:34.721 --> 00:14:36.261
In your practice project,

483
00:14:36.261 --> 00:14:37.261
use these three.

484
00:14:37.261 --> 00:14:39.401
And if you type ls with the

485
00:14:39.401 --> 00:14:41.921
