00:15:08.861 --> 00:15:11.921
So ls checks that the path exists,

502
00:15:11.921 --> 00:15:13.781
but only by opening the file do

503
00:15:13.781 --> 00:15:15.681
you know whether it's current.

504
00:15:16.461 --> 00:15:18.841
Denise set aside ten minutes on her

505
00:15:18.841 --> 00:15:21.241
calendar, every first Monday of the month,

